      <mxCell id="s16_r_txt1" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#D56E0C;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Customer-controlled HSM root of trust&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#3C4043;'&gt;• Tenant holds the FIPS 140-3 Level 3 Cloud HSM key ring and approves admin access via Cloud Access Approval.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#3C4043;'&gt;• Signed Gemma 3 27B weights load from an air-gapped CMEK bucket with zero external internet pulls.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF6E9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#D56E0C;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
