      <mxCell id="s16_r_txt3" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#D56E0C;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Silicon memory encryption &amp;amp; &amp;lt; 60s kill-switch&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#3C4043;'&gt;• AMD EPYC SEV-SNP encrypts model weights, KV-cache, and prompts in DRAM so plaintext never leaves CPU registers.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#3C4043;'&gt;• Disabling the customer CMEK halts every pod and DB connection in 41.2s (&amp;lt; 60s SLA).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF6E9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#D56E0C;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
