      <mxCell id="s17_lc2_txt" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#202124;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Guardrail 02 · PgBouncer Transaction Reset &amp;amp; 32k Prefix Order&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• Transaction pooler enforces DISCARD ALL on release + SET LOCAL app.current_tenant_id.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#5F6368;'&gt;• 89.9% static prefix share (32,768 / 36,468 tok) with 0 customer bytes in shared cache.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#202124;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
