      <mxCell id="s18_intro_card" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#D56E0C;'&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.18;'&gt;Progressive 4-step rollout with zero agent code forks&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='height:3px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#3C4043;'&gt;• Every step builds on the same 5-Hop cryptographic identity and AlloyDB FORCE RLS foundation.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.22;color:#3C4043;'&gt;• Each phase ends with an automated fail-closed CI/CD exit gate before promoting production traffic.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF6E9;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#D56E0C;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=16;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
